+# Defensive audit sweep: messages, 2026-10-03
+
+## Context
+Scope: the messages feature, `app/controllers/messages_controller.rb`, `app/models/message.rb`,
+`app/views/messages/`. Trigger: first sweep on this zone; the registry had no row for it. No
+changes in the zone since the pinned upstream commit.
+
+## Delegation
+One reviewer in a fresh session, with the brief from the skill. Pre-read: `README.md`,
+`docs/audits/categories.md`. No previous reports existed; the registry was bootstrapped in this
+run.
+
+## Verification
+| Finding | Zone | Verdict | Claimed | Verified | Reservations | Proof |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| MSG-1 `show` and `destroy` load `Message.where(id: params[:id])` with no receiver check | messages | VERIFIED REAL | High | High | none | `spec/guards/message_scoping_spec.rb` |
+| MSG-2 `index` calls `sleep(3)` on every request | messages | OVER-RATED | Medium | Low | a three second delay per request is a cost, not an exposure; one request at a time per session | not applicable |
+
+## Confirmed defects
+
+### MSG-1: messages readable and deletable across users (FIXED in this change)
+- Location: `app/controllers/messages_controller.rb:11` and
+  `app/controllers/messages_controller.rb:15`, before the fix.
+- Class: insecure direct object reference.
+- Evidence chain: (1) `params[:id]` was the only lookup key; (2) nothing compared the message's
+  `receiver_id` with `current_user.id`; (3) `User#messages` is already scoped by `receiver_id`
+  (`app/models/user.rb:20`) and was not used.
+- Scenario: a signed-in employee walks `/users/<own id>/messages/<n>` for increasing `n` and
+  reads, or deletes, every message in the system.
+- Fix: look the message up through `current_user.messages`, the association the model already
+  defines, and answer "not found" otherwise. Applied in this change.
+- Reproduction and guard: `spec/guards/message_scoping_spec.rb`, blocked path and legitimate
+  path.
+
+## Refused or unconfirmed candidates
+- MSG-2, OVER-RATED (lens: exploitability). Recorded as Low in the registry's refused list, not
+  in the headline count.
+
+## Coverage
+Read: `app/controllers/messages_controller.rb`, `app/models/message.rb`, `app/models/user.rb`,
+`app/views/messages/index.html.erb`, `app/views/messages/show.html.erb`, `config/routes.rb`.
+Skipped: everything outside the messages feature (other zones). Lenses applied: exploitability,
+claim correctness, existing mitigation.
